OL,3,AInjuries reported in attack on airport
OL,4,Ain Saudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been injured in
OL,7,Fanother attack on an international
OL,8,Fairport in the Saudi capital Riyadh,
OL,9,Freports say, days after Yemen's Houthis
OL,10,Fclaimed to have carried out strikes on
OL,11,Fthe hub.
OL,13,FKing Khalid International Airport in
OL,14,FRiyadh was evacuated after a loud blast
OL,15,Fwas heard on Saturday, two
OL,16,Finternational news agencies have
OL,17,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
